  "title": "Central Pacific Bank earns Forbes’ \"Best Bank in Hawaii\" recognition for third consecutive year",
  "summary": "Central Pacific Bank (CPB) is deeply honored to be recognized as the top bank in Hawaii on the Forbes list of America’s Best-In-State Banks 2026. This marks the third consecutive year CPB has received this distinction, which is awarded in partnership with Statista, a leading global provider of market data and industry rankings.",
